	<TextRow
		Label="pw_turn_hero_0"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>さけぶ　おんな『ねえ！　だれかー！
だれか　たすけてーっ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>さけぶ　女『ねえ！　だれかー！
だれか　助けてーっ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-11-18T13:32:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-11-18T13:32:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_turn_hero_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あおざめた　おとこ『ひぃー！
もうダメだー！　ＵＦＯがっ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>青ざめた　男『ひぃー！
もうダメだー！　ＵＦＯがっ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-11-08T05:35:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-11-08T05:35:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_turn_hero_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あせる　おんな『じゃまよ！　どいて！
アタシが　さきに　にげるんだ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あせる　女『邪魔よ！　どいて！
アタシが　先に　逃げるんだ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_turn_hero_3"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>にげおくれた　おとこ『おーい！
おいていかないで　くれー！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>逃げ遅れた　男『おーい！
置いていかないで　くれー！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_turn_hero_4"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なく　こども『わーん！　やだよー！
おにいちゃん！　まってよー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>泣く　子供『わーん！　やだよー！
おにいちゃん！　まってよー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_turn_hero_5"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あわてる　おとこ『くそーっ！！
ＵＦＯ　なんかに　つかまって▽
たまるかよ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あわてる　男『くそーっ！！
ＵＦＯ　なんかに　捕まって▽
たまるかよ！！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-11-30T08:50:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-11-30T08:50:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_turn_hero_6"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>つかれた　こども『はあっ……
もう……　はしれないよ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>疲れた　子供『はあっ……
もう……　はしれないよ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event0_hero_0"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>つうしん『おい！　きこえるか！？
おうとうせよ！　[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]！▽
じょうきょうを　ほうこくしろ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-12-05T07:37:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-12-05T07:37:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>通信『おい！　聞こえるか！？
応答せよ！　[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]！▽
状況を　報告せよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-11-30T08:50:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-11-30T08:50:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event0_hero_1"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『りょうかい！▼
きょだいな　ＵＦＯから
ポケモンが　しゅつげん！▽
しみんを　おそっています！▼
にげまどう　ひとびとで　まちは
だいこんらんに▽
おちいって　います！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『了解！▼
巨大な　ＵＦＯから
ポケモンが　出現！▽
市民を　襲っています！▼
逃げ惑う　人々で　街は
パニック状態に▽
おちいって　います！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-11-16T10:07:52" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-11-16T10:07:52" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event0_hero_2"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>つうしん『よし　りょうかいだ！▼
まずは　しみんの　あんぜんの
かくほを　さいゆうせんに　しろ！▼
おそわれている　ひとびとを　たすけ
あんぜんな　ばしょ　まで▽
ゆうどうしろ！　いいな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-11-30T08:50:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-11-30T08:50:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>通信『了解！▼
いいか？　まずは　市民たちの
安全の確保を　最優先にしろ！▼
襲われている人々を　助け
安全な　場所　まで▽
誘導しろ！　いいな！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-11-30T08:50:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-11-30T08:50:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event0_hero_3"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『ラジャー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『ラジャー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-14T09:40:17" />
